'''Courts of Agony''' (絶・奈落門, ''Zetsu・Narakumon'', '''Absolute・Naraka Gate''') is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 11.2 Update|Version 11.2]] and appears every 11th, 12th, 25th and 26th of every month. It is unlocked after clearing [[The Pure Land (Merciless)|Courts of Torment]]. The first stage yields 1,000,000 XP when first completed, while the second stage drops the [[True Form]] of [[Medusa Cat (Rare Cat)|Medusa Cat]] - Naga Cat.

